{"1804730": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DEPRISION", "steam_appid": 1804730, "required_age": "17", "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804730/extras/f15a6bc09bf46c3a3fbb41df894d7bd9.avif?t=1783977910\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804730/extras_big/f15a6bc09bf46c3a3fbb41df894d7bd9.avif?t=1783977910 width=800 height=195 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A CLASSIFIED EXPERIMENT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DEPRISION is a first-person survival horror game focused on psychological survival within a classified mind manipulation experiment. Trapped in a state of forced consciousness, your mind becomes the only means to move forward and endure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804730/extras/31f51ef20b0b1cf8c84d38f6dc62570f.poster.avif?t=1783977910\" width=800 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804730/extras/31f51ef20b0b1cf8c84d38f6dc62570f.webm?t=1783977910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804730/extras/31f51ef20b0b1cf8c84d38f6dc62570f.mp4?t=1783977910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>DISTORTED MEMORIES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore environments built from personal memories and experiences, now altered and distorted. Familiar places become hostile spaces you must traverse carefully, paying attention to the surroundings and the threats that inhabit them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804730/extras/3d11fcc09191796266de75fa0dbd63ee.poster.avif?t=1783977910\" width=800 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804730/extras/3d11fcc09191796266de75fa0dbd63ee.webm?t=1783977910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804730/extras/3d11fcc09191796266de75fa0dbd63ee.mp4?t=1783977910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>PERSONAL THREATS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The threats you encounter are not foreign or impersonal. They are manifestations deeply tied to your past, designed to provoke emotional distress and constant tension. Your survival will depend on your ability to explore, manage limited resources, avoid danger, and make decisions under pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804730/extras/ca12f029c7a2a346320e1fef61e5b4f6.poster.avif?t=1783977910\" width=800 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804730/extras/ca12f029c7a2a346320e1fef61e5b4f6.webm?t=1783977910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804730/extras/ca12f029c7a2a346320e1fef61e5b4f6.mp4?t=1783977910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>PSYCHOLOGICAL SURVIVAL HORROR</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DEPRISION opts for oppressive, narrative-driven, psychological horror, where atmosphere, sound, and uncertainty are just as important as what you see.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804730/extras/f15a6bc09bf46c3a3fbb41df894d7bd9.avif?t=1783977910\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804730/extras_big/f15a6bc09bf46c3a3fbb41df894d7bd9.avif?t=1783977910 width=800 height=195 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A CLASSIFIED EXPERIMENT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DEPRISION is a first-person survival horror game focused on psychological survival within a classified mind manipulation experiment. Trapped in a state of forced consciousness, your mind becomes the only means to move forward and endure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804730/extras/31f51ef20b0b1cf8c84d38f6dc62570f.poster.avif?t=1783977910\" width=800 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804730/extras/31f51ef20b0b1cf8c84d38f6dc62570f.webm?t=1783977910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804730/extras/31f51ef20b0b1cf8c84d38f6dc62570f.mp4?t=1783977910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>DISTORTED MEMORIES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore environments built from personal memories and experiences, now altered and distorted. Familiar places become hostile spaces you must traverse carefully, paying attention to the surroundings and the threats that inhabit them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804730/extras/3d11fcc09191796266de75fa0dbd63ee.poster.avif?t=1783977910\" width=800 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804730/extras/3d11fcc09191796266de75fa0dbd63ee.webm?t=1783977910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804730/extras/3d11fcc09191796266de75fa0dbd63ee.mp4?t=1783977910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>PERSONAL THREATS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The threats you encounter are not foreign or impersonal. They are manifestations deeply tied to your past, designed to provoke emotional distress and constant tension. Your survival will depend on your ability to explore, manage limited resources, avoid danger, and make decisions under pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804730/extras/ca12f029c7a2a346320e1fef61e5b4f6.poster.avif?t=1783977910\" width=800 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804730/extras/ca12f029c7a2a346320e1fef61e5b4f6.webm?t=1783977910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804730/extras/ca12f029c7a2a346320e1fef61e5b4f6.mp4?t=1783977910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>PSYCHOLOGICAL SURVIVAL HORROR</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DEPRISION opts for oppressive, narrative-driven, psychological horror, where atmosphere, sound, and uncertainty are just as important as what you see.</p>", "short_description": "DEPRISION is a first-person survival horror game where you are the subject of a classified mental manipulation experiment. Explore environments distorted by memories and trauma, survive a system that adapts to your personal fears, and endure traumatic threats.", "supported_languages": "Spanish - Spain, Spanish - Latin America, English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Italian, Catalan<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804730/header.jpg?t=1783977910", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804730/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783977910", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804730/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783977910", "website": "https://deprisiongame.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-10100F | AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1660 Ti 6GB | Radeon RX 5600 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 30 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Windows-compatible audio device<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> You should be able to play at 70 FPS on Medium–High quality settings or 50 FPS on Epic quality settings at Full HD (1080p) resolution, without upscaling technologies such as DLSS or FSR enabled. An SSD is recommended.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-10400 | AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 24 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 12GB | Radeon RX